"""Honda wiring, read from the wiring diagram page of Honda's own competition handbook (owner-supplied 2026-11-26).
First file: 2025 CRF450R / CRF450RX. Everything here was read off the diagram by eye, so it is medium confidence
until a second read. Facts only; the handbook and its diagram are not stored. usage: python3 scripts/knowledge/wiring2.py"""
import sys,os
sys.path.insert(0,os.path.join(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)),'pre2020'))
from _lib import File
F=File('wiring2_crf450r_2025','w-h1','Wiring from the competition handbook: Honda CRF450R and CRF450RX 2025 (wiring pass 2026-11)','Honda',['CRF450R','CRF450RX'],[2025])
M=['CRF450R','CRF450RX'];Y=[2025,2026];D='ecu_electronics'   # the 2026 handbook prints the same diagram (identical text layer)
s=F.src('manufacturer',"Honda 2025 CRF450R/RX/RWE/R-S competition handbook, wiring diagram page 3-23",'https://cdn.powersports.honda.com/documentum/MWOM/ml.remawmom.amker2525chen.pdf','2024')
N='Read from the wiring diagram by eye; check the diagram on the bike before cutting, splicing or back-probing.'
def R(t,st,v): F.R(D,t,M,Y,st,v,'OEM',s,'medium',N)
R('Wire colour code',"Honda's wire colour letters on the 2025 and 2026 CRF450R: Bl black, Y yellow, Bu blue, G green, R red, W white, Br brown, O orange, Lb light blue, Lg light green, P pink, Gr gray. Two colours with a slash mean a base colour with a stripe, so Y/R is yellow with a red stripe.",{'Bl':'black','Y':'yellow','Bu':'blue','G':'green','R':'red','W':'white','Br':'brown','O':'orange','Lb':'light blue','Lg':'light green','P':'pink','Gr':'gray'})
R('Electrical components on the wiring diagram',"The 2025 and 2026 CRF450R wiring diagram shows: the ECM (one 33-pin black connector), alternator, regulator/rectifier, 12 V 2.3 Ah battery, starter motor, starter relay switch with a 10 A fuse, a starter/main relay unit with a diode, fuel pump unit, fuel injector, ignition coil and spark plug, crank position (CKP) sensor, throttle position (TP) sensor, intake pressure (MAP) sensor, intake air temperature (IAT) sensor, coolant temperature (ECT) sensor, gear position switch, the starter switch, and the left handlebar switch with the engine stop, engine mode select and HSTC (traction control) buttons and their blue, orange and green indicator LEDs. There is also a 4-pin data link connector (DLC) for diagnostics.",{'ecm_connector':'33-pin, black','battery':'12 V 2.3 Ah','fuse_a':10})
R('ECM connector pinout',"ECM pinout on the 2025 and 2026 CRF450R (33-pin connector, pin: signal, wire colour). A-1 IGP power in, black. A-2 PRC, white/black. A-3 HSTC indicator, gray. A-4 injector, pink. A-5 map mode indicator, blue. A-6 PG1 ground, green/black. A-7 warning indicator, orange. A-9 starter relay, yellow/black. A-10 fuel pump, white. A-11 ignition coil, yellow/blue. A-12 VCC 5 V sensor supply, red/yellow. A-15 throttle position signal, yellow. A-17 SG sensor ground, green/red. A-18 gear position, brown. A-19 intake air temperature, gray. A-21 coolant temperature, pink. A-22 PG2 ground, green. A-23 and A-24 crank position sensor, blue/yellow and white/yellow. A-26 K-line diagnostics, orange/black. A-27 intake pressure signal, light blue. A-28 SCS service check, brown. A-29 starter switch, blue/black. A-30 HSTC switch, yellow/red. A-31 map mode switch, light green. A-32 engine stop switch, white. A-33 LG logic ground, green. Pins A-8, A-13, A-14, A-16, A-20 and A-25 are empty.",{'A-1':'IGP Bl','A-2':'PRC W/Bl','A-3':'HSTC IND Gr','A-4':'INJ P','A-5':'MAP MODE IND Bu','A-6':'PG1 G/Bl','A-7':'WARN O','A-9':'ST-RLY Y/Bl','A-10':'FLP W','A-11':'IG Y/Bu','A-12':'VCC R/Y','A-15':'TH Y','A-17':'SG G/R','A-18':'GP Br','A-19':'TA Gr','A-21':'TW P','A-22':'PG2 G','A-23':'PCM Bu/Y','A-24':'PCP W/Y','A-26':'K-LINE O/Bl','A-27':'PB Lb','A-28':'SCS Br','A-29':'ST-SW Bu/Bl','A-30':'HSTC SW Y/R','A-31':'MAP MODE SW Lg','A-32':'ENG STOP SW W','A-33':'LG G'})
R('Sensor and engine wiring',"Sensor wiring on the 2025 and 2026 CRF450R. The three-wire sensors share the red/yellow 5 V supply and the green/red sensor ground. Throttle position sensor: red/yellow, green/red and a yellow signal wire. Intake pressure (MAP) sensor: red/yellow, green/red and a light blue signal wire. Intake air temperature sensor: gray signal and green/red ground. Coolant temperature sensor: pink signal and green/red ground. Crank position sensor: blue/yellow and white/yellow. Gear position switch: brown to the ECM, grounded through the switch. Fuel injector: black power feed and a pink wire switched by the ECM. Ignition coil: yellow/blue from the ECM on the coil's black (+) terminal and a green ground wire on its green (-) terminal. Fuel pump: black power feed and a white wire switched by the ECM.",{'tps':'R/Y, G/R, Y','map':'R/Y, G/R, Lb','iat':'Gr, G/R','ect':'P, G/R','ckp':'Bu/Y, W/Y','gear_switch':'Br','injector':'Bl, P','coil':'Y/Bu (+ terminal), G (- terminal)','fuel_pump':'Bl, W'})
R('Handlebar switch and indicator wiring',"Left handlebar switches on the 2025 and 2026 CRF450R each connect one ECM wire to ground when pressed: engine stop is white, engine mode select is light green and HSTC is yellow/red; the common ground is green. The starter switch uses blue/black. The three indicator LEDs each run through a resistor: blue for the mode indicator on a blue wire, orange for the warning light on an orange wire and green for HSTC on a gray wire. To check a switch, look for continuity between its wire and green with the button pressed and none with it released.",{'stop_switch':'W to G','mode_switch':'Lg to G','hstc_switch':'Y/R to G','starter_switch':'Bu/Bl','mode_led':'Bu','warn_led':'O','hstc_led':'Gr'})
R('Charging, battery and starting circuit',"Charging and starting on the 2025 and 2026 CRF450R: the alternator feeds the regulator/rectifier through three yellow wires, and the regulator's output charges a 12 V 2.3 Ah battery. A 10 A fuse sits at the starter relay switch. A combined starter/main relay unit with a diode powers the bike: the main relay feeds the black power wires to the ECM, injector and fuel pump. The starter switch signals the ECM on blue/black, and the ECM drives the starter relay on yellow/black. Battery negative and the engine ground wires are green.",{'alternator_leads':'Y, Y, Y','fuse_a':10,'battery':'12 V 2.3 Ah','ground_colour':'G'})
F.write()
